WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:08.980
In the Philippines you can be charged with
the crime of "unjust vexation" for doing just

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:17.590
that, vexing someone.

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.690
In the Arctic Town of Longyearbyen, dying
is against the law.

00:00:22.690 --> 00:00:26.490
This is because bodies don't decompose in
the permafrost.

00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:33.300
So if you fall terminally ill you will hastily
be despatched by plane to the Norwegian mainland,

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:36.150
where you can die without being arrested.

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:43.190
In Mobile, Alabama, it is against the law
to throw confetti or spray silly string.

00:00:43.190 --> 00:00:50.650
In Saudi Arabia, it's illegal for any woman
to drive a car or vote in the general election.

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:54.880
Although this is due to be changed in 2015.

00:00:54.880 --> 00:00:57.620
In Singapore chewing gum is illegal.

00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:02.820
If you get caught "dealing" chewing gum you
can get fined up to $2,000.

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:10.609
There is a law in South Carolina called the
no "mock proposal" law, which states that

00:01:10.609 --> 00:01:16.490
anybody above the age of 16 is not allowed
to perform a proposal if they don't really

00:01:16.490 --> 00:01:17.920
mean it.

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:24.149
In Montana, "proxy weddings" are allowed for
those serving in the military, which means

00:01:24.149 --> 00:01:30.249
a friend can pretend to be the groom or the
bride and the marriage will still be considered

00:01:30.249 --> 00:01:31.249
valid.

00:01:31.249 --> 00:01:35.020
In some cases both the bride and the groom
are absent.

00:01:35.020 --> 00:01:41.840
In Arkansas there still exists a law from
the 1800s that states a husband is allowed

00:01:41.840 --> 00:01:45.489
to beat his wife, but only once a month.

00:01:45.489 --> 00:01:51.979
The UK has its fair share of highly unusual
laws, In Britain it is illegal to handle a

00:01:51.979 --> 00:01:55.119
salmon in suspicious circumstances.

00:01:55.119 --> 00:02:02.009
Also, in Britain, it is illegal to import
potatoes into England or Wales if you have

00:02:02.009 --> 00:02:05.969
reasonable cause to believe that they are
Polish.

00:02:05.969 --> 00:02:11.780
In Britain it is illegal to operate a cow
while intoxicated.

00:02:11.780 --> 00:02:18.450
In York, England, it is perfectly legal to
shoot a Scotsman with a bow and arrow.

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:21.030
On any day except Sundays.

00:02:21.030 --> 00:02:26.160
In England it is actually illegal to be drunk
in a pub.

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:32.840
In Liverpool, England, it is illegal for a
woman to be topless except as a clerk in a

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:34.530
tropical fish store.

00:02:34.530 --> 00:02:40.310
In parts of India, a man who is in debt can
offer up his wife as collateral until the

00:02:40.310 --> 00:02:41.819
debt is paid.

00:02:41.819 --> 00:02:48.079
In Hong Kong, there's a law that allows a
wife to kill her husband if she finds him

00:02:48.079 --> 00:02:49.079
cheating.

00:02:49.079 --> 00:02:53.730
However, she must kill him with her bare hands.

00:02:53.730 --> 00:02:58.409
In Samoa it is illegal to forget your wife's
birthday.

00:02:58.409 --> 00:03:02.540
In France, it is illegal to name a pig Napoleon.

00:03:02.540 --> 00:03:10.540
In Russia, Vladimir Putin just recently made
it illegal to tell kids that gay people exist.

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:15.939
In La Crosse, Wisconsin it is illegal to "worry
a squirrel".

00:03:15.939 --> 00:03:21.859
In Alabama it is illegal to wear a fake moustache
that causes laughter in church.

00:03:21.859 --> 00:03:29.329
In Pacific Grove, California, "molesting"
butterflies can result in a $500 fine.

00:03:29.329 --> 00:03:35.890
In Florida it's against the law to dream about
another man's wife or cow.

00:03:35.890 --> 00:03:39.489
In Minnesota it's illegal to sleep naked.

00:03:39.489 --> 00:03:49.049
And finally, in Virginia and Wyoming it's
illegal to tickle women.

